text_en:
5.35 Sanctions and penalties.
Each component will inform its employees and contractors of the Privacy Act's civil liability provisions (
5 U.S.C. 552a(g)
) and criminal penalty provisions (
5 U.S.C. 552a(i)
) as they apply to Privacy Act and JRA complaints.

